{"3926130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "INKARO", "steam_appid": 3926130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INKARO is a brutal Parkour FPS that is a cross between the flow-state platforming of Mirror's Edge and the push forward combat of DOOM 2016. Roam complex megastructures to gain an advantage over a varied roster of anomalous enemies - doling out punishment with a toybox of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric, Pixelated Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/extras/b738aee5e54d47317687a3e36138fcd4.poster.avif?t=1760923756\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/extras/b738aee5e54d47317687a3e36138fcd4.webm?t=1760923756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/extras/b738aee5e54d47317687a3e36138fcd4.mp4?t=1760923756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Roam desolate <strong>megastructures</strong> reminiscent of Tsutomu Nihei's 'Blame!'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flow-state Parkour Platforming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/extras/40e899bff3add3aa80330826208836ce.poster.avif?t=1760923756\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/extras/40e899bff3add3aa80330826208836ce.webm?t=1760923756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/extras/40e899bff3add3aa80330826208836ce.mp4?t=1760923756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Run, jump, slide and </strong><strong><u>rocket-jump</u></strong> to send yourself flying across massive combat arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Push Forward Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/extras/9d9eeba49d1704e01681aedd293348e1.poster.avif?t=1760923756\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/extras/9d9eeba49d1704e01681aedd293348e1.webm?t=1760923756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/extras/9d9eeba49d1704e01681aedd293348e1.mp4?t=1760923756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick and choose from<strong> 10 unique weapons </strong>to best punish your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Psychokinesis</strong> to fling physics objects and move huge pillars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harvest the despair of your enemies</strong> in glory-kill style &quot;coup-de-grace&quot; animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry</strong> projectiles to send them flying back toward enemies. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mysterious, Grimdark Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/extras/3ed0f8231273e06b3cf3da72185568f1.poster.avif?t=1760923756\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/extras/3ed0f8231273e06b3cf3da72185568f1.webm?t=1760923756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/extras/3ed0f8231273e06b3cf3da72185568f1.mp4?t=1760923756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no stars, galaxies, planets. Nothing but the labyrinthian, tangling clusters of tubes that stretch far beyond the horizon. The sky is a sickening shade of brown, shrouded by the toxic haze of decaying plastic. The sun looms high, scathing and melting countless tons of plastic into molten seas of polymer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layers of plastic megastructures are stacked with no rhyme or reason, with reality-bending creatures lurking in every crevice and shadow. A place not meant to be inhabited by humans, filled with things not meant to be understood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of people have slipped into and met their final resting place in <strong>playSPACE</strong>. Death and despair fills every gap, from tattered missing posters raining down to the frantic crayon drawings of scared children.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INKARO is a brutal Parkour FPS that is a cross between the flow-state platforming of Mirror's Edge and the push forward combat of DOOM 2016. Roam complex megastructures to gain an advantage over a varied roster of anomalous enemies - doling out punishment with a toybox of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric, Pixelated Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/extras/b738aee5e54d47317687a3e36138fcd4.poster.avif?t=1760923756\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/extras/b73