d met their final resting place in <strong>playSPACE</strong>. Death and despair fills every gap, from tattered missing posters raining down to the frantic crayon drawings of scared children.</p>", "short_description": "INKARO is a brutal Parkour FPS that crosses flow-state platforming and push forward combat against anomalous enemies - doling out punishment with a toybox of weapons. Roam megastructures of plastic and concrete in a desolate journey of revenge and violence, clad in armor of ink and bone.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/b1d14107471e72d9a580aa0bca674f8adb8a04d3/header.jpg?t=1760923756", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/7bb8d83b0fbbb467749152834bcd8f196fffd443/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760923756", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926130/7bb8d83b0fbbb467749152834bcd8f196fffd443/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760923756", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 3060</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Psychospace Digital"], "publishers": ["Psychospace Digital"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 68, "